  "limitations": [
    "The long footprint, steep crossed-apex gable and entrance hierarchy are documented. Exact heights, rear details and the stair threshold are visual estimates. The museum’s published central dimension is not labeled by axis.",
    "The original 256-meter elevation field is unchanged. Apparent side grades may include vegetation or later work and are approximations of the 2008 conditions.",
    "The original artworks in the two mosaic panels are outside scope. The model uses a generic tiled surface for their position and material. The separate palace, railway station and museum collection are outside scope."
  ],
  "sourceLicense": "Original deterministic geometry under the repository license. Footprint from OpenStreetMap. Verified photographer-released exterior references inform the architecture. Mosaic materials are generic and do not depict the original artworks.",
